DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261016T210000
SUMMARY:Star Gazing at Hurlburt Field
LOCATION:Lil' Commando Community Park\, McMillan St\, Hurlburt Field\, FL 3
 2544
DESCRIPTION:Friday 10/16 · 5:00 PM to 9:00 PM\n\nThe Hurlburt Field Base L
 ibrary\, the Hurlburt Youth Center and the Northwest Florida Astronomy Ass
 ociation host a night of star gazing on Friday\, October 16 from 5:00 PM t
 o 9:00 PM. Astronomers help visitors find and view planets\, and guests ar
 e welcome to bring their own telescope. The event sets up on Youth Center 
 Ball Park Fields 3 and 4.\n\nPrice: No published price\n\nDetails: https:/
 /coastaleventures.com/events/ev-hurlburt-star-gazing-1016.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-hurlburt-star-gazing-1016.html
CATEGORIES:STEM and learning
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
