SUMMARY:Laser Etching: Custom Keychain FOB at the SEA Makerspace
LOCATION:Downtown Pensacola\, Museum of Commerce\, 201 E Zaragoza St\, Pens
 acola\, FL 32502
DESCRIPTION:Saturday 10/17 · 9:00 AM to 1:00 PM\n\nThis hands on workshop 
 at the Museum of Commerce in downtown Pensacola teaches you to prepare art
 work\, operate a laser cutter\, and make a wooden keychain fob. Finishing 
 it also qualifies you to use the SEA Makerspace laser on your own afterwar
 d. It runs Saturday morning from 9 AM to 1 PM\, and tuition is $65 per per
 son.\n\nPrice: from $65\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev
 -laser-etching-custom-keychain-fob-at-the-sea-1017.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-laser-etching-custom-keychain-fo
 b-at-the-sea-1017.html
CATEGORIES:STEM and learning
