SUMMARY:Curiosity Lab: Frankenstein
LOCATION:Pensacola MESS Hall\, 116 N Tarragona St\, Pensacola\, FL 32502
DESCRIPTION:Saturday 10/17 · 1:00 PM to 4:00 PM\n\nOctober's Curiosity Lab
  goes spooky: kids build their own monster mechanisms using string finger\
 , jumping jack\, and automata mechanics. It suits ages 7 and up and is inc
 luded with general admission. The rest of the museum\, including mess kits
 \, is open for exploration 10 AM to 5 PM the same Saturday.\n\nPrice: from
  $15\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-curiositylab-frank
 enstein-mess.html
