SUMMARY:Makerspace Studio Fall 2026
LOCATION:Downtown Pensacola\, Museum of Commerce\, 201 E Zaragoza St\, Pens
 acola\, FL 32502
DESCRIPTION:Wednesdays · 5:30 PM to 7:30 PM\n\nThis hands on course at the
  Museum of Commerce in downtown Pensacola covers 3D printers\, laser engra
 vers\, CNC mills\, sewing\, electronics\, and other fabrication tools. No 
 prior experience is required\, and it meets Wednesday evenings from 5:30 P
 M to 7:30 PM\, September 23 through November 4\, with no class October 7. 
 Tuition runs $215 per person.\n\nPrice: from $215\n\nDetails: https://coas
 taleventures.com/events/ev-makerspace-studio-fall-2026-0923.html
