  planetarium turns Halloween themed for Spooky Secrets of the Stars\, mixi
 ng eerie space facts with mythological monsters and a tour of the solar sy
 stem. The show is recommended for ages 5 and up and runs at 6 PM on Thursd
 ay. Nonmember admission is $12\, and Science Center members pay $10.\n\nPr
 ice: from $12\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-planetari
 um-special-feature-spooky-secrets-o-1022.html
