LOCATION:Exploreum Science Center\, 65 Government St.\, Mobile\, AL 36602
DESCRIPTION:Saturday 10/31 · 5:00 PM to 9:00 PM · film at 6:30 PM\n\nThe 
 Exploreum's Fear Fest ends on Halloween night with The Conjuring on the PC
 I Digital Dome Theater screen at 6:30 PM. A ticket also covers the Fear ex
 hibit\, which explains the science behind phobias and fear responses\, plu
 s themed button making in the Atrium. The Exploreum rates the featured fil
 ms R and recommends the night for guests 17 and older.\n\nPrice: from $12\
 n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-exploreum-fear-fest-con
