LOCATION:Destin Community Center\, 101 Stahlman Avenue\, Destin\, FL 32541
DESCRIPTION:Mondays 11/2\, 11/9\, 11/16 and 11/30 · 6:00 PM to 7:30 PM\n\n
 The Destin Community Center runs an evening cooking class for middle schoo
 lers ages 10 to 14\, where the group cooks basic meals\, eats together and
  socializes. Supplies are provided\, and the center asks cooks to wear clo
 sed-toe shoes and tie long hair back. The fee covers the full series of Mo
 nday sessions.\n\nPrice: from $40\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com
 /events/ev-destin-cooking-lab-1102.html
