 obot artist\, creates artwork live on the Saenger stage\, followed by a pa
 nel discussion with experts in artificial intelligence. Pensacola State Co
 llege presents the evening as part of the 2026 Foo Foo Festival. The festi
 val week also includes a free reception and a family robotics event at the
  Pensacola MESS Hall.\n\nPrice: No published price\n\nDetails: https://coa
 staleventures.com/events/ev-saenger-ai-da-1102.html
