SUMMARY:From Current to Code Kids Workshop
LOCATION:National Maritime Museum of the Gulf\, 155 South Water Street\, Mo
 bile\, AL 36602
DESCRIPTION:Saturday 11/7 · 10:00 AM to 12:00 PM\n\nChildren ages 7 to 12 
 build simple circuits\, learn how electrical energy works and send coded m
 essages on real telegraph sets at the National Maritime Museum of the Gulf
 . The two-hour hands-on workshop covers electricity\, circuits and Morse c
 ode. A phone reservation is required\, and the museum is open Wednesday th
 rough Sunday.\n\nPrice: from $15\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/
 events/ev-nmmog-current-to-code-1107.html
